{"parse": {"title": "有琴歌-02", "pageid": 128593, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%89%E7%90%B4%E6%AD%8C-01\" title=\"有琴歌-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">有琴歌-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%89%E7%90%B4%E6%AD%8C-03\" title=\"有琴歌-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">有琴歌</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.8F.AD.E8.8D.86\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"班荆\">班荆</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 班荆</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Like Old Friends</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">21:04 山中、小径 雾</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">山中，小径</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_icon_5.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian icon 5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/Rolestory_getian_icon_5.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_icon_5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/Rolestory_getian_icon_5.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_icon_5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/Rolestory_getian_icon_5.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_icon_5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"540\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p>雨直到入夜才停下。乌云散去后，月亮也慢慢升起来。<br />\n月光照亮处，一滴露水沿着细长的叶茎缓缓滑到叶尖。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“便是此处。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>灭蒙鸟收敛羽翼，落在半山的一片空地上。<br />\n去岁枯叶已被露水浸润，而其下的新草尚未长成，柔软得像一张毯子。<br />\n——穿过小径，<span class=\"tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help; color: #ff7a06;\">陋室<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left; translate: 0px;\">——一间普普通通的低矮茅屋，屋脊上压着几块青石。<br />此间主人是葛天的某位同族，只是他们尚未打过照面，那人便下山去了，再未回来。<br />如今暂住的，是一位误入山中的人类乐师。</span></span>就在眼前。<br />\n他扬起翅膀，骨杖便轻盈地悬浮到空中，笃笃叩响门扉。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">山中，陋室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p>在那一点少得可怜的柴火燃尽之前，乐师不得不将碾碎的茶末一点点撒入水中。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“虽说水只沸了一次……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>炉里的火慢慢暗下去。他叹了口气，将茶汤分入好不容易翻找出的两枚杯盏。<br />\n陶盏颇有古意，并非近年的形制；水是新取的山涧溪水，用红泥小炉仔细煮开。<br />\n斟好的茶被推到访客面前。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“多谢。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>灭蒙鸟没有饮茶的习惯，但还是探出翅膀拢了拢杯盏。在略显寒冷的春夜，温热的水总能让人心中熨帖不少。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“这茶汤的气味，与我从前所知，似有不同。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>乐师将茶具挪到一边，在葛天对面坐下。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“您虽一直居于山中，对山下的事物倒比我想象中熟悉。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"山下之事，非我所好\">山下之事，非我所好</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"的确有所耳闻\">的确有所耳闻</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"山下之事，非我所好\">\n<p>葛天谨慎地闻了闻，将之稍稍推开。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“山下之事，非我所好。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“只是同族留下过许多记录，因此，我或多或少有所了解。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #bc9567; padding: 0 5px;\"><big><b>由于您的选择，心中的疑惑增加了</b></big></span></div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"的确有所耳闻\">\n<p>葛天谨慎地闻了闻。清香，苦涩。真是奇怪。<br />\n……许是因为，各人煮出的味道都不尽相同。他想。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“下山的灭蒙鸟会带回消息，以及时兴的器物和技法。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“因此，我或多或少知道一些。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“只是我并未亲自体会，终究算不上熟悉。”<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>灭蒙鸟摇了摇头，换了个话题。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“你的琴，如今修好了吗？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>顺着他的目光，乐师看向身侧古朴的长琴，将手轻轻压在琴弦上。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“山中找不到修补的材料，只能日后再说了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“真是可惜……原本还打算为您弹奏一曲呢。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“无事。你的骨头既已长好，下山的日子恐怕也不会远。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“是啊……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>他望着晃动的烛影怔怔出神。<br />\n啪。<br />\n沉默中，唯有灯花寂寞地爆开。<br />\n乐师似是被这极轻的一声惊到，回过神来。他旋即笑着对葛天欠身。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“我叨扰太久，再待下去就显得不识趣了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“山中虽好，究竟不是我的归处。我来的时候江水还未解冻，但山下此刻大概已是春天，沛霖川两岸的花也该开了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“现在离开，顺着东风从江上走，或许还赶得及入夏前回去，向樵夫讨一块今春的好桐木。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“如此，你也不再找那卷琴谱了吗？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>乐师摇了摇头。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“这烛光实在太暗。能劳烦您拨亮些吗？”<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">点击拨亮烛火</small><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian interact 2 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"107\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"469\" /></a></div><div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_interact_2_3.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian interact 2 3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_3.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_3.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_3.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"540\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“好些了，多谢。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>他瞥了一眼灯烛，很快收回目光，再次含笑望向灭蒙鸟。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“琴谱……唉，我确实是为它来到山中。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“您救下我的那日，我眼见天色一点点变暗，四下豺狼啸叫，拖着断腿、抱着琴坐在树下动弹不得……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“心中仍旧惦记着那卷传闻中的琴谱。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“如果豺狼要来叼我的肉，不知能否把这双手留下？如此，我好歹能够继续弹琴。”<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_icon_6.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian icon 6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Rolestory_getian_icon_6.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_icon_6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Rolestory_getian_icon_6.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_icon_6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Rolestory_getian_icon_6.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_icon_6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"540\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“唉，我那时忍不住胡思乱想：要是真有<span class=\"tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help; color: #ff7a06;\">神仙<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left; translate: 0px;\">对人类而言，灭蒙鸟确实是仙人一般的存在。<br />人首鸟身的神秘学家，栖居在常人所不能抵达的深山，拥有悠长的寿数。<br />而最为可畏，也最为诱人的，是他们能够改换骨相、扭转运命的神秘术。</span></span>从天而降该多好，就如从前您那位赠予我先祖乐谱的同族一般。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“不必如此称呼，灭蒙鸟与人类并无不同，亦有消亡之时。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“可于我来说，这确实是仙人般的恩惠！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>乐师在烛光下摊开手，指尖与指腹满是厚厚的茧子。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“虽未寻得乐谱，这一双弹琴的手得以保全，确然是有赖于您。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>灭蒙鸟有些不自在地抖了抖羽毛。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“罢了，随你。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>乐师对葛天笑笑。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“只是现下看来，既已找了这许久，这琴谱大约不在山上……抑或和我没有缘分，不能强求。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“再说，我此行也算是如先祖那般得见了仙人，等回去谱一首新的曲子，说不准能比当年那首更好呢！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>灭蒙鸟沉思着，指爪轻轻敲击地面。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“你已经有了决定，那便如此吧。夜路难行，待到天明，我送你下山。”<br />\n</p>\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>葛天：</b></span>“只是，山中还有一处地方，或许留存着曲谱的线索。既然你明日便要离开，今夜不妨随我一观。”<br /></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "有琴歌-02"}}